dict.txt.big — bundled dictionary for the `nlp` crate
=====================================================

File:    dict.txt.big
Source:  https://github.com/fxsjy/jieba (extra_dict/dict.txt.big)
Purpose: Traditional + Simplified Chinese dictionary with POS tags, used to
         give jieba-rs good segmentation/tagging for Traditional Chinese notes.
Format:  one entry per line — `詞 詞頻 詞性`

